<title>USA: Morgan Stanley unit offering utility service.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley unit offering utility service.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co said Friday its Margan Stanley Capital Group subsidary began offering on Wednesday services for utilities at Associates Electric Cooperative Inc's transmission system.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley will quote prices at which it would be willing to buy and sell energy and capacity delivered at the AECI system.</p>
<p>Utilities can request quotes from periods a few days away up to several months away.</p>
</text>
